	(text_box "Wiring Harness Note\n\nAll harnesses shall be constructed using #22 AWG stranded\nconductor, 1kV rated, PVC insulated wire (or cross-linked\npolyolefin where higher temperature rating is required).\nConductors shall be color-coded per MIL-STD-681D (see chart\nbelow). Terminations shall be crimped using approved tooling\nwith pull-test verification per IPC/WHMA-A-620, Chapter 19.\nHarnesses shall be bundled with lacing cord or expandable\nbraided sleeving; tie-wraps are acceptable only in non-vibration\nenvironments per drawing callout. All harnesses require 100%\ncontinuity and 500V DC hipot testing prior to release. RoHS\ncompliance required unless otherwise specified.\n\nCOLOR CODE CHART (MIL-STD-681D)\n\nCond#  Color      Abbr\n-----  ---------- ----\n  0    Black      BLK\n  1    Brown      BRN\n  2    Red        RED\n  3    Orange     ORG\n  4    Yellow     YEL\n  5    Green      GRN\n  6    Blue       BLU\n  7    Violet     VIO\n  8    Gray       GRY\n  9    White      WHT"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 203.2 15.24 0)
		(size 60.96 126.1927)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
